{{!--
  Redirect page for a story that left its address (fifthbell/cronkite#148). It is
  written at the old page key because the static origin does not honour object
  redirect metadata. It sends the reader to the current story at once, tells
  crawlers where the story lives now and keeps itself out of the index. The
  target is the public site origin plus the intent's route only; the input
  schema allows only path routes, and each context escapes it: HTML attributes
  through Handlebars, the script through jsonString. If an edge 301 answers
  first, this page is simply never served.
--}}
<!doctype html>
<html lang='{{language}}'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <meta name='robots' content='noindex' />
    <meta http-equiv='refresh' content='0; url=https://fifthbell.com{{toRoute}}' />
    <link rel='canonical' href='https://fifthbell.com{{toRoute}}' />
    <title>fifthbell</title>
    <script>window.location.replace('https://fifthbell.com' + {{{jsonString toRoute}}});</script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p><a href='https://fifthbell.com{{toRoute}}'>{{#if (eq language 'es')}}Ir a la noticia{{else if (eq language 'it')}}Vai alla notizia{{else}}Go to the story{{/if}}</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
